OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers hurt and teen
OL,4,Aarrested after chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter crashing into a marked police car
OL,8,Fduring a chase, injuring two officers.
OL,10,FHumberside Police was called to Byron
OL,11,FGrove, Grimsby, at 13:00 BST after
OL,12,Freports of a car being stolen. Officers
OL,13,Fpursued the car, which was "driving
OL,14,Ferratically", before it crashed into a
OL,15,Fpolice car on Queen Mary Avenue in
OL,16,FCleethorpes.
OL,18,FThe injured officers have been taken to
OL,19,Fhospital with injuries that are not
OL,20,Fthought to be life-changing, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
