OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers hurt and teen
OL,4,Aarrested after chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe teenager was arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof dangerous driving, theft of a motor
OL,8,Fvehicle and failing to stop for police.
